MF2 REPEATERED SPAN -- non-reclocking regenerators
  A biphase repeater is a comparator and a driver: no clock, no
  one-shots, nothing per-rate but the input filter, nothing in the
  hut to drift and no clock to slip against.  It restores amplitude
  completely and edge timing not at all.
  Cell 3906 ns.  The §9.4 classifier rounds a gap against
  0.75 cell with +/-13% tolerance measured (mf8-spec.md §9.4), so
  the peak-to-peak budget for displacement is about 1016 ns.
  Window 1.0 s x 3 seeds, quiet.

